WEBVTT

00:05:31.716 --> 00:05:33.557
Feels like we are back in school?

00:05:33.557 --> 00:05:34.691
(Laughter)

00:05:38.351 --> 00:05:41.368
Three, we all know it's an odd number.

00:05:41.838 --> 00:05:45.808
And if I multiply three
with another odd number,

00:05:45.808 --> 00:05:48.987
it gives me a result which
is definitely an odd number.

00:05:48.987 --> 00:05:50.276
Like this one here:

00:05:50.276 --> 00:05:53.147
Three times three gives us nine.


00:05:53.797 --> 00:05:55.007
An odd number.

00:05:55.917 --> 00:05:59.208
And then I noticed something
very interesting about it.

00:05:59.838 --> 00:06:04.347
If I multiply an odd number
with an even number,